    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d476">

                <pb facs="0561" n="465" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg465"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Baron Fava to Mr.
                            Hill.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lenox, Mass.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-09-29"><hi rendition="#italic">September 29,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Please kindly wire if it is from your special agent that you are awaiting
                    expected additional information mentioned in your telegram of 25th instant.
                    Thanks.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fava.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
